    "updated_at": "2015-10-20T08:44:54Z",
    "body": "Oh, right you are. So at step 9.4, _resize_ will be false and _exitDocs_ will consist of only _doc_ itself. I suppose things start to go wrong at step 9.5, where all descendant documents are collected instead of just the ones in _exitDocs_.\n\nBoth <b>unfullscreen an _element_</b> and <b>unfullscreen a _document_</b> are low-level operations, so if there's a fix for this that would be contained inside the definition of <b>exit fullscreen</b>, that would be nice.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
