    "updated_at": "2015-10-20T09:07:27Z",
    "body": "Yeah, it does look like the removing steps can end up simply calling <b>unfullscreen _node_</b> for iframes whose content document has a fullscreen element. That looks like an unrelated bug, though, probably those steps worked when fullscreen element stack had to be in tree order?\n",
