    "created_at": "2015-10-20T09:13:41Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-10-20T09:13:41Z",
    "body": "Yeah, it worked before, because iframe if any may only be the top in the fullscreen element stack.\n\nI think those steps should be moved to **unfullscreen node** because descendent document is part of iframe elements, and thus whenever you unfullscreen the element, its inner document should always get unfullscreened as well, no?\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
